# OCI 11.2's ORA-24756 to a rollback of a branch a read-only prepare ended, to Oracle 11g XE 11.2.0.2, the piggybacks ahead of it left out.
# Captured 2026-11-08 through tools/capture_proxy.py: an OCI 11.2 program
# (instant client 11.2, x86-64 Linux; OCITransStart and the rest, with an
# XID of format 1001, gtrid '1tr' or its digit's, bqual 'bql'). The TTC payload,
# without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the offset column and the
# |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  04 01 00 00 00 1c 00 01  01 00 00 00 b4 60 00 00  |.............`..|
00000010  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 08 00 00 8d 75 02 00  |.............u..|
00000020  04 00 00 00 14 2b 00 00  01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |.....+..........|
00000030  00 1d 00 00 01 00 00 00  36 01 00 00 00 00 00 00  |........6.......|
00000040  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  20 f6 31 0a 00 00 00 00  |........ .1.....|
00000050  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000060  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000070  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000080  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  26 4f 52 41 2d 32 34 37  |........&ORA-247|
00000090  35 36 3a 20 74 72 61 6e  73 61 63 74 69 6f 6e 20  |56: transaction |
